"Japanese passports normally use two letters followed by seven digits." = "日本護照號碼通常由兩個英文字母及七位數字組成。";
"US passport books normally use nine digits or one letter followed by eight digits." = "美國護照號碼通常為九位數字，或一個英文字母及八位數字。";
"Passport rules vary by issuer. Country-specific checks currently cover Japan and the US." = "護照號碼規則因核發國家而異。目前支援日本及美國的特定格式檢查。";

/* Structured input assistance */
"This value is too long for a format check. It will be kept." = "此值過長，無法檢查格式。將保留原值。";
"Format matches. Existence and validity are not checked." = "格式相符。未檢查是否真實存在或有效。";
"Check the email address: name@example.com." = "請檢查電子郵件地址：name@example.com。";
"This email format is not checked. The address will be kept." = "此電子郵件格式不在檢查範圍內。將保留該地址。";
"Check the URL, including its scheme, such as https://." = "請檢查URL，包括https://等協定前綴。";
"The URL scheme is recognized syntactically. Service-specific rules are not checked." = "已辨識URL協定的語法。未檢查服務特定規則。";
"Check the card number length, digits, and check digit." = "請檢查卡號的長度、數字和檢查碼。";
"This card brand may use different check-digit rules. Confirm the number with the issuer." = "此卡片品牌可能使用不同的檢查規則。請向發卡機構確認號碼。";
"Card check digit matches. Card validity and issuer are not checked." = "卡號檢查碼相符。未檢查卡片有效性或發卡機構。";
"Security codes usually contain three digits; American Express uses four." = "安全碼通常為3位數字；American Express使用4位。";
"Check the IBAN letters, digits, and check digits." = "請檢查IBAN的字母、數字和檢查碼。";
"IBAN check digits match. National format and account existence are not checked." = "IBAN檢查碼相符。未檢查國家格式或帳戶是否存在。";
"BIC uses eight or eleven letters and digits, with a two-letter country code." = "BIC由8位或11位字母和數字組成，其中包含2位字母的國家代碼。";
"Enter a server port from 1 to 65535." = "請輸入1至65535之間的伺服器連接埠。";
"Modern VINs use 17 letters and digits without I, O, or Q. Older or local chassis numbers may differ." = "現代VIN由17位字母和數字組成，不含I、O、Q。舊式或地方車身編號可能不同。";
"VIN format matches. Regional check digits and vehicle existence are not checked." = "VIN格式相符。未檢查地區檢查碼或車輛是否存在。";
"Check the ninth VIN character for a US-registered vehicle." = "請檢查美國登記車輛VIN的第9位字元。";
"Check the Base32 secret: letters A–Z and digits 2–7." = "請檢查Base32密鑰：字母A–Z和數字2–7。";
"Enter the secret key here, rather than the whole otpauth URL." = "請在此輸入密鑰，而非完整的otpauth URL。";
"This date is earlier than its related start, issue, or birth date. Check both dates." = "此日期早於相關的開始日期、核發日期或出生日期。請檢查這兩個日期。";
"Common ports" = "常用連接埠";
"Choose the port specified by your server provider." = "請選擇伺服器供應商指定的連接埠。";
"Add https://" = "加入https://";
